{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Haven 是一款專為 iPhone 用戶設計的錄影自動備份工具，能解決影片記錄過程中的數據丟失風險。該應用目前限時免費提供下載，讓用戶以零成本享受專業級的视频保護服務，特別適合需要高頻率拍攝且重視素材安全的創作者及日常使用者。</p>\n\n<h2>邊錄邊存防意外</h2>\n<p>Haven 的核心功能在於錄製過程中即時上傳影片至雲端，無需等待拍攝結束。即使設備中途故障、遺失或沒電，已錄製片段仍受保護。應用採用加密技術確保隱私，並針對大文件優化以降低耗電量與儲存佔用，實現全自動備份體驗，用戶可隨時存取或刪除內容，掌握完整控制權。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-653-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-654-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-655-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-656-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-657-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-658-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Haven: Never Lose a Recording</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T00:58:47.370994+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":314,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}